{"id": "53789b13d1e1cd4", "title": "彭阳县消防救援站建设项目施工招标公告", "sourceUrl": "https://ggzyjy.fzggw.nx.gov.cn/dzjy/001001/001001001/001001001001/20260702/b76a7398-0d80-4c8d-bb61-4228950f1036.html", "date": "2026-07-02", "source": "宁夏公共资源交易中心", "content": "彭阳县消防救援站建设项目施工招标公告1. 招标条件本招标项目彭阳县消防救援站建设项目已由彭阳县审批服务管理局以关于彭阳县消防救援站建设项目初步设计的批复、彭审批发〔2026〕93号批准建设，项目业主为彭阳县应急管理局，建设资金来自宁夏消防救援总队、固原市消防救援支队补助经费和大队结余经费资金及争取自治区发改补助建设资金，剩余为县级财政配套资金，招标人为彭阳县应急管理局。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目施工进行公开招标。宁夏盛豪工程项目管理有限公司（招标代理机构）受招标人委托负责本工程的招标事宜。2. 项目概况与招标范围2.1项目概况：项目规划用地面积约17401m²,总建筑面积6725.81m², 其中地上6475.81m²、地下250m²。（1）执勤业务楼工程：新建地上4层钢筋混凝土框架结构执勤业务楼1栋4128.81m²,建筑高度18.45m，耐火等级二级。（2）体能技能训练中心工程：新建地上主体1层局部3层、地下1层钢筋混凝土框架结构体能技能训练馆1栋1909m² ( 地上1659m² 、地下250 m²),建筑高度15m,地上耐火等级二级、地下耐火等级一级。（3）器材库工程：新建地上1层钢筋混凝土框架结构器材库1栋360m², 建筑高度7.2m，耐火等级二级。（4）训练塔工程：新建地上5层钢筋混凝土框架结构训练塔1栋310m², 建筑高度18.4m, 耐火等级二级。（5）室外哨楼工程：新建地上1层成品哨楼1个18m², 建筑高度3.6 m。（6）室外附属建筑工程：新建混凝土地面6600m² 、嵌草水泥砖停车场240m²、混凝土道牙1200m；安装铁艺围墙500m 、成品大门2个；拆除原有破损混凝土地面13500m²、拆除原有卫生间200m²、 拆除原有给水管网100m；绿化移植68棵；场地土方平衡3900m³；规划机动车停车位23个，其中普通停车位13个、消防车停车位 10个；硬化室外训练场4400m²等。（7）室外附属管网工程：敷设室外De160聚乙烯PE(PE80)给水塑料管515m、De110聚乙烯PE(PE80)给水塑料管80.2m、De75 聚乙烯PE(PE80)给水塑料管16.6m、De50聚乙烯PE(PE80)给水塑料管16.6m、室外消防管De100钢丝网骨架给水管122m、DN400钢筋混凝土排水管121m、DN300钢筋混凝土排水管388m、DN200钢筋混凝土排水管700m、DN100整体式预制防腐硬质聚氨酯泡沫保温管338m;敷设直埋式电力电缆2011.6m;新建混凝土单篦雨水口52个等。2.2建设地点：彭阳县白阳镇姚河村(东至姚河村集体土地、南至兴彭大街(义丰路)、西至南关街、北至姚河村集体土地)2.3计划工期：工期 365日历天2.4招标范围：招标文件、工程量清单及施工图纸范围内的全部内容2.5标段划分：本招标项目施工共计一个标段注：说明本次招标项目的建设地点、规模、计划工期、招标范围、标段划分（如果有）等。3. 投标人资格要求3.1本次招标要求投标人应具备独立承担民事责任能力的法人或依法成立的其他组织，且同时具有建筑工程施工总承包叁级及以上资质，具备有效的安全生产许可证，并在人员、设备、资金等方面具有相应的施工能力，其中，投标人拟派项目经理须具备建筑工程专业贰级及以上注册建造师执业资格（注册建造师执业资格），具备有效的安全生产考核合格证书，且未担任其他在施建设工程项目的项目经理。3.2本次招标不接受（接受或不接受）联合体投标。联合体投标的，应满足下列要求：（接受联合体投标时填写）。4. 招标文件的获取4.1 凡有意参加投标者，请于2026-07-02 08:30至2026-07-09 23:59（北京时间，下同），登录“宁夏回族自治区公共资源交易平台”（以下简称“电子交易平台”）免费下载电子版招标文件。联合体投标的，由联合体牵头人下载招标文件。4.2 “电子交易平台” 实行CA数字证书安全登录管理。5. 投标文件的递交5.1 投标文件递交的截止时间（投标截止时间，下同）为2026-07-24 09:00，投标人应在截止时间前通过“电子交易平台”递交电子投标文件。5.2 逾期送达的投标文件，“电子交易平台”将予以拒收。6. 发布公告的媒介本次招标公告在“宁夏回族自治区公共资源交易网”、“中国招标投标公共服务平台”（发布公告的媒介名称）上发布。7. 联系方式招标人：彭阳县应急管理局地 址：固原市彭阳县邮 编：756500联 系 人：郭伟电 话：13895147680招标代理机构：宁夏盛豪工程项目管理有限公司地 址：宁夏银川市金凤区新昌西路金钻名座1号综合写字楼邮 编：750000联 系 人：牛娜娜电 话：173412620508.招标投标监督部门 本项目招标投标监督部门为彭阳县住房和城乡建设局，联系电话：0954-7017555 2026-07-02 function ResizeToScreen(id, pX, pY) { var obj = document.getElementById(id); obj.style.display = \"\"; obj.style.left = pX+\"px\"; obj.style.top = pY+\"px\"; document.body.scrollTop = pY - 200; } [A6404000141100488001001]彭阳县消防救援站建设项目.NXZF 招标人信用承诺书.pdf 招标公告.pdf", "html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:21px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:29px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 宋体;\">彭阳县消防救援站建设项目施工招标公告</span></strong></p><p style=\"line-height:150%\"><strong><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;line-height:150%;font-size:21px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\">1. <span style=\"font-family:宋体\">招标条件</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">本招标项目</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">彭阳县消防救援站建设项目</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">已由</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">彭阳县审批服务管理局</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">以</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">关于彭阳县消防救援站建设项目初步设计的批复、彭审批发〔</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">〕</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">93</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">号</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">批准建设，项目业主为</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">彭阳县应急管理局</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">，建设资金来自</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">宁夏消防救援总队、固原市消防救援支队补助经费和大队结余经费资金及争取自治区发改补助建设资金，剩余为县级财政配套资金</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">，招标人为</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">彭阳县应急管理局</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">施工</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">进行公开招标。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">宁夏盛豪工程项目管理有限公司</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">（招标代理机构）受招标人委托负责本工程的招标事宜。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:150%\"><strong><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;line-height:150%;font-size:21px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\">2. <span style=\"font-family:宋体\">项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\">2.1</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">项目概况：</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">项目规划用地面积约</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">17401m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">²</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">总建筑面积</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">6725.81m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">²</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">其中地上</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">6475.81m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">²、地下</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">250m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">²。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）执勤业务楼工程：新建地上</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">层钢筋混凝土框架结构执勤业务楼</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">栋</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">4128.81m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">²</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">建筑高度</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">18.45m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">，耐火等级二级。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）体能技能训练中心工程：新建地上主体</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">层局部</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">层、地下</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">层钢筋混凝土框架结构体能技能训练馆</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">栋</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1909m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">² </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">( </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">地上</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1659m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">² 、地下</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">250 m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">²</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">),</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">建筑高度</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">15m,</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">地上耐火等级二级、地下耐火等级一级。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）器材库工程：新建地上</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">层钢筋混凝土框架结构器材库</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">栋</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">360m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">²</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">建筑高度</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">7.2m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">，耐火等级二级。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）训练塔工程：新建地上</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">层钢筋混凝土框架结构训练塔</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">栋</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">310m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">²</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">建筑高度</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">18.4m, </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">耐火等级二级。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）室外哨楼工程：新建地上</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">层成品哨楼</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">个</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">18m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">²</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">建筑高度</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">3.6 m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">6</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）室外附属建筑工程：新建混凝土地面</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">6600m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">² 、嵌草水泥砖停车场</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">240m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">²、混凝土道牙</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1200m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">；安装铁艺围墙</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">500m </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、成品大门</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">个；拆除原有破损混凝土地面</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">13500m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">²、拆除原有卫生间</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">200m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">²、 拆除原有给水管网</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">100m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">；绿化移植</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">68</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">棵；场地土方平衡</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">3900m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">³；规划机动车停车位</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">23</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">个，其中普通停车位</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">13</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">个、消防车停车位 </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">个；硬化室外训练场</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">4400m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">²等。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">7</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）室外附属管网工程：敷设室外</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">De160</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">聚乙烯</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">PE(PE80)</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">给水塑料管</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">515m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">De110</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">聚乙烯</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">PE(PE80)</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">给水塑料管</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">80.2m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">De75 </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">聚乙烯</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">PE(PE80)</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">给水塑料管</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">16.6m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">De50</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">聚乙烯</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">PE(PE80)</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">给水塑料管</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">16.6m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、室外消防管</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">De100</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">钢丝网骨架给水管</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">122m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">DN400</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">钢筋混凝土排水管</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">121m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">DN300</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">钢筋混凝土排水管</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">388m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">DN200</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">钢筋混凝土排水管</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">700m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">DN100</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">整体式预制防腐硬质聚氨酯泡沫保温管</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">338m;</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">敷设直埋式电力电缆</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2011.6m;</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">新建混凝土单篦雨水口</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">52</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">个等。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\">2.2</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">建设地点：</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">彭阳县白阳镇姚河村</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">东至姚河村集体土地、南至兴彭大街</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">义丰路</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、西至南关街、北至姚河村集体土地</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">)</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2.3</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">计划工期：</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">工期</span> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">365</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">日历天</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\">2.</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">招标范围：</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">招标文件、工程量清单及施工图纸范围内的全部内容</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\">2.</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">标段划分：</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">本招标项目施工共计一个标段</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">注：</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">说明本次招标项目的建设地点、规模、计划工期、招标范围</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">、</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">标段划分（如果有）等</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:150%\"><strong><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;line-height:150%;font-size:21px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\">3. <span style=\"font-family:宋体\">投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-indent:29px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">3.1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">本次招标要求投标人应具备独立承担民事责任能力的法人或依法成立的其他组织，且同时具有建筑工程施工总承包叁级及以上资质，具备有效的安全生产许可证，并在人员、设备、资金等方面具有相应的施工能力，其中，投标人拟派项目经理须具备</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">建筑工程专业贰级及以上注册建造师执业资格</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">（</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">注册建造师执业资格</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">，</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">具备有效的安全生产考核合格证书，</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">且未担任其他在施建设工程项目的项目经理。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">3.2</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">本次招标</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">不接受</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">（接受或不接受）联合体投标。联合体投标的，应满足下列要求：</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">（接受联合体投标时填写）</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:150%\"><strong><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;line-height:150%;font-size:21px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\">4. <span style=\"font-family:宋体\">招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-left:7px;text-indent:24px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\">4.1</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">凡有意参加投标者，请于</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2026-07-02 08:30</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">至</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2026-07-09 23:59</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">（北京时间，下同）</span></span><span style=\";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">，</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">登录</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">“宁夏回族自治区公共资源交易平台”（以下简称“电子交易平台”）</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">免费下载</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">电子版招标文件。</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">联合体投标的，由联合体牵头人下载招标文件。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:28px;line-height:27px\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">4.2 </span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">“电子交易平台” 实行</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">CA</span><span sty